  4	We use \textbf{boldface font} to denote random variables.
  5	For two complex numbers $\alpha, \beta \in \C$, we write
  6	$\alpha \approx_{\eps} \beta$ if
  7	\begin{equation*}
  8	|\alpha - \beta| \leq \eps.
  9	\end{equation*}
 10	We note the following triangle inequality for numbers, which we will use repeatedly:
 11	\begin{equation}\label{eq:triangle-inequality-for-numbers}
 12	\text{if $\alpha \approx_{\eps} \beta$ and $\beta \approx_{\delta} \gamma$, then $\alpha \approx_{\eps+\delta}\gamma$.}
 13	\end{equation}
